OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a largely sunny start
OL,6,Fcloud will gradually increase, as
OL,7,Fscattered light showers arrive across
OL,8,Feastern areas, most frequent across
OL,9,FKent where a sharp shower is possible.
OL,10,FFeeling cooler than Friday. Breezy
OL,11,Falong the northern coasts. Lighter
OL,12,Fwinds elsewhere.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FIsolated showers may linger
OL,15,Facross Kent this evening, otherwise
OL,16,Fbecoming dry, mainly clear and also
OL,17,Fchilly. Later heavy showers reach
OL,18,FKent, perhaps extending slightly
OL,19,Ffurther west. Breezy along northern
OL,20,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
