OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FShowers or longer spells of
OL,6,Frain across Kent gradually spread
OL,7,Fwestwards through the afternoon,
OL,8,Fturning heavy at times, although
OL,9,Fpredominantly across Kent. Feeling
OL,10,Frather cool. Windy along the Kent
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOften
OL,14,Fcloudy with a chance of patchy rain
OL,15,FMonday and Tuesday, but also some
OL,16,Fdrier periods. Potentially spells of
OL,17,Fheavy rain for Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,18,Fwill be generally near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
